                                "sense_id": "ba336e85-261c-3d21-891f-faa13378e2d1",
                                "text": "But it's worth noting that, despite the dancers' skintight unitards (of a chameleonic fabric that picked up whatever color shone on it), the sexes are barely distinguishable."
                            },
